{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>According to all His statutes.</b> These are the commandments that are in its body — an unblemished male, a year old." "<b>And according to all His ordinances.</b> These are the commandments upon its body from another place, such as seven days for matzah and for removal of leaven. (Commandments in its body — an unblemished male, a year old; upon its body — roasted with fire, its head on its legs and on its innards; outside its body — matzah and removal of leaven.)"], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:03.160054321Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}